window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She’s a fugitive from another time. He’ll set her free or die trying.</b></p> <p>Framed for murdering her ex-boyfriend, US Army officer Amber Ryan flees to Scotland and hides out in the ruins of Inverlochy Castle. But when a Highland faerie transports her back to 1308, she’s catapulted into a fierce skirmish alongside a handsome warrior.</p> <p>Highlander Owen Cambel is shocked to see a gorgeous woman valiantly battling men in the castle. He risks everything to save her, only to lead them both into English captivity. Amber can’t help falling for the rebellious Scot. Will they survive to build a future together?</p> <p><b>Narrated by the award-winning narrator, Audie finalist, and Earphones winner for excellence in narration Shane East, and Siiri Scott,</b><b><i> </i></b><b>the head of acting and directing at the University of Notre Dame with over 20 years of experience in voice acting.</b></p>"; 
